---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CV & Skills | Maitri Shah"
  description="Interactive technical stack and education track for collaborative AI engineering roles."
>
  <header>
    <p class="bento-kicker">CV & Skills</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Technical Toolkit and Academic Track</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">
      Contributed to reproducible model evaluation workflows and developed as part of a team infrastructure support for high-volume research competitions.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section glass-card">
    <h2>Interactive Tech Stack</h2>

    <p class="bento-kicker">Daily Drivers</p>
    <div class="skill-chip-row">
      <span class="skill-chip">Python</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">PyTorch</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">Scikit-learn</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">Pandas</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">NumPy</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">TensorFlow</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">SQL</span>
      <span class="skill-chip">Java</span>
    </div>

    <p class="bento-kicker" style="margin-top:1rem;">Infrastructure</p>
    <div class="skill-chip-row">
      <span class="skill-chip infra">SLURM</span>
      <span class="skill-chip infra">Docker (Basic)</span>
      <span class="skill-chip infra">Linux/SSH</span>
      <span class="skill-chip infra">Weights & Biases</span>
      <span class="skill-chip infra">Hugging Face</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section glass-card">
    <h2>Education Timeline</h2>
    <div class="edu-timeline">
      <article class="edu-node">
        <p class="metric metric-blue">M.Sc. Data Science & AI | Universität des Saarlandes</p>
        <p>Contributed to advanced coursework and research development in trustworthy machine learning and optimization.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="edu-node">
        <p class="metric metric-blue">B.Tech. Artificial Intelligence | SVKM'S NMIMS University</p>
        <p>Developed as part of a team project and thesis record with <span class="metric metric-amber">CGPA 3.95/4.0</span>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section glass-card">
    <h2>References</h2>
    <ul class="clean">
      <li><a href="/assets/pdf/Maitri_Shah_CV.pdf">Download CV (PDF)</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/maitri01">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maitri-shah01">LinkedIn</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
